================================================================================
NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY MODELS (NOT COVERED BY THE MIT LICENSE ABOVE)
================================================================================

The MIT license above applies ONLY to the swap-fase source code in this
repository. It does NOT apply to the machine-learning models the application
uses. Those models are NOT distributed with this repository — they are
downloaded separately at runtime into a (gitignored) `models/` directory — and
they carry their own, more restrictive licenses:

  * InsightFace `buffalo_l` face-analysis pack
  * `inswapper_128.onnx` face-swap model

Both are provided by InsightFace (https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface)
and are licensed for NON-COMMERCIAL / RESEARCH USE ONLY. The original public
download of `inswapper_128.onnx` was withdrawn by its authors and it is now
community-mirror-hosted.

You are responsible for complying with these model licenses. swap-fase is
intended for strictly personal, local, experimental use, which fits the
non-commercial / research terms. Do NOT use these models — or this software in
combination with them — for any commercial purpose or in any published product.
